<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Ginebra, Alaska beat rivals in PBA.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Ginebra, Alaska beat rivals in PBA.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinal round games on Friday night in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference, which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Formula Shell 106-89 (55-37)</p>
<p>(Alaska leads best-of-five series 2-0)</p>
<p>Ginebra San Miguel beat San Miguel Beer 115-111 (65-37)</p>
<p>(Ginebra San Miguel and San Miguel Beer tied at 1-1)</p>
</text>
